    <briefdescription>
<para>Point-in-time snapshot of all distribution receipts for a shard. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used for shard recovery ordering: given a snapshot, the recovery process can replay only the receipts issued after snapshot_receipt_count, avoiding duplicate re-application. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
